Notebook[{
Cell["InfraSceneHighlight", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"5dbee67b-287d-4877-b7c6-23c849bd3937"],

Cell["[LLM Generated]", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"b73cba98-4315-48c5-895d-43fdc46463b7"],

Cell["\<\
InfraSceneHighlight[g, multiObjects] renders a list of multi-objects \
diffusely on graph g, with intensity scaling by overlap within each object \
and color-blending across objects. InfraSceneHighlight[g, obj] is the \
single-object shortcut for InfraSceneHighlight[g, {obj}]. Each entry is \
auto-classified by representation; explicit Infra* wrappers force the \
intended semantics. Per-object style overrides via `entry -> color`, `entry \
-> Directive[dirs]`, `Style[entry, dirs__]`, or `entry -> {opts...}` with a \
flat option list auto-sorted into vertex (VertexStyle / VertexSize / \
VertexShapeFunction), edge (EdgeStyle / EdgeShapeFunction), and per-object \
diffusion (\"OpacityRange\" / \"ThicknessRange\" / \"PointSizeRange\") \
channels. Options: \"OpacityRange\", \"ThicknessRange\", \"PointSizeRange\".\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9781c50f-88ab-4104-b76a-de42dac8fa37"],

Cell["Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"88bd39c4-959a-48a4-a84a-c88a73e6dd3f"],

Cell["Load the paclet.", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"b0d7fce4-540b-414f-9974-e3c6d8fcb467"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<WolframInstitute`SyntheticInfrageometry`\>\"", 
  "]"}]], "Code",
 InitializationCell->
  True,ExpressionUUID->"99f7bc4f-576d-4097-8859-a4e05e14fef4"],

Cell["Related Guides", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7216bd34-7ed5-4e5c-a15c-60d09d8ce90f"],

Cell["VisualizationGuide", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3fadeff0-49de-44b9-b51f-fd352d34390c"],

Cell["SyntheticInfrageometryGuide", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"103df0ea-4889-4a47-b6e8-feb89c14649d"]
},
